### Enrollment 생성 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "lectureId": 2
}

### Enrollment 업데이트 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollment/click
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentId": 1
}

### Enrollment 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}